# Supabase platform

## Components

| Piece    | GFM usage                                                                         |
| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Postgres | `guest_submissions`, org/property tables, inbox, finance — `supabase/migrations/` |
| Auth     | Google OAuth admin; guests unauthenticated on public routes                       |
| Storage  | Booking assets, property media, inbox attachments                                 |
| Edge     | All business logic — `supabase/functions/`                                        |
| Realtime | Inbox thread updates (RLS-scoped)                                                 |

No Drizzle — raw SQL migrations + `@supabase/supabase-js` in Deno.

## Migrations

- New file per change: `supabase/migrations/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_description.sql`
- Never edit shipped migrations
- Runbook: `docs/archive/operations/migration-runbook.md`

## Env

| Scope                 | File                                                                                           |
| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| UI                    | `ui/.env.development`, `ui/.env.example` — `VITE_SUPABASE_*`                                   |
| Edge secrets          | `supabase/.env.local` (gitignored), `supabase/.env.example`                                    |
| Local functions serve | `supabase/.temp/functions-serve.env` (generated by `scripts/dev/build-local-functions-env.sh`) |

Document new vars in `docs/architecture/validation-and-env.md`.

## Local dev

- Full stack: `./dev.sh` (Docker required for `supabase start`)
- UI-only: `./dev.sh --ui-only` + hosted project URL in UI env
- CLI: `bunx supabase@latest` via `bun run start:supabase`

## Storage

- Buckets + policies in migrations
- Booking uploads: `{propertyId}/{bookingId}/…`
- Public vs signed URLs — guest forms use paths returned from edge

## RLS

Admin scoping is primarily **edge-function checks** today; tighten RLS per [`docs/README.md`](../../docs/README.md) (Epic 14).

## MCP

Configured in `.mcp.json` (root, symlinked at `.cursor/mcp.json`): `supabase` server for schema/logs/advisors (read-only by default), `playwright` server for driving guest/auth flows in a real browser (used by the `verify` skill). See `.claude/README.md` for the full server list and required env vars.
